Just tried out a wand of death with a character with magic resistance
and no reflection (in wizard mode).

I zap it against a wall:
The death ray bounces!  The death ray hits you!  You aren't affected.


Then I tried againt without the cloak of magic resistance, but with
a shield of reflection:
The death ray bounces!  The death ray hits you!--More--
But it reflects from your shield!  The death ray bounces!--More--
The death ray hits you!  But it reflects from your shield!

I'm not sure if a touch of death is any different, but it seems that
either magic resistance or reflection is effective against death rays.

